    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yoosiyaah Oo U Dabbaaldegay Iiddii Kormaridda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo Yoosiyaah Yeruusaalem ayuu Rabbiga ugu dhawray Iiddii Kormaridda, oo neefafkii Kormariddana waxaa la gowracay bishii kowaad maalinteedii afar iyo tobnaad. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo wadaaddadiina ayuu shuqulkoodii loo amray u kala qaybiyey, oo adeegiddii gurigii Rabbiga ayuu ku dhiirrigeliyey. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo kuwii reer Laawi oo dadka Israa'iil oo dhan wax bari jiray ee Rabbiga aawadiis quduus u ahaa wuxuu ku yidhi, Sanduuqa quduuska ah waxaad gelisaan gurigii uu dhisay Sulaymaan oo uu dhalay boqorkii reer binu Israa'iil oo Daa'uud ahaa, hadda ka dib culaab dambe garbihiinna saarnaan mayso, haddaba Rabbiga Ilaahiinna ah iyo dadkiisa reer binu Israa'iil u adeega. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isu diyaariya sida reerihiinna iyo kooxihiinnu yihiin si waafaqsan qorniinkii uu qoray Daa'uud oo ahaa boqorkii reer binu Israa'iil, iyo si waafaqsan qorniinkii wiilkiisa Sulaymaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo waxaad isu taagtaan meesha quduuska ah sida qaybaha reerihii walaalihiin oo ah dadka dalka ay kala yihiin, oo reerihii qaar reer Laawi ahi ha isu qaybiyeen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo neefafka Kormaridda gowraca, oo quduus iska dhiga, oo walaalihiinna u diyaariya, si aad u samaysaan si waafaqsan Eraygii Rabbiga oo Muuse loo soo dhiibay.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa Yoosiyaah wuxuu dadkii intii joogtay oo dhan adhigii ka siiyey baraar iyo waxarro si ay qurbaannada Kormaridda u bixiyaan, oo tiradooduna waxay isku ahayd soddon kun, iyo saddex kun oo dibi, intaasu waxay ahaayeen intii boqorku maalkiisa ka baxshay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo amiirradiisii iyagoo raalli ka ah ayay wax siiyeen dadkii iyo wadaaddadii iyo kuwii reer Laawi. Oo Xilqiyaah iyo Sekaryaah iyo Yexii'eel oo ahaa taliyayaashii guriga Ilaahna waxay wadaaddadii qurbaannadii Kormaridda u siiyeen laba kun iyo lix boqol oo neef oo yaryar, iyo saddex boqol oo dibi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo weliba Kaananyaah iyo walaalihiis oo ahaa Shemacyaah iyo Netaneel, iyo Xashabyaah iyo Yecii'eel iyo Yoosaabaad oo ahaa madaxdii reer Laawi waxay reer Laawi qurbaannadii Kormaridda u siiyeen shan kun oo neef oo yaryar, iyo shan boqol oo dibi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sidaasaa hawshii loo hagaajiyey, oo wadaaddadii iyo kuwii reer Laawina waxay kala istaageen meelahoodii siday kooxahoodii kala ahaayeen, taasoo waafaqsan boqorka amarkiisii. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasay gowraceen neefafkii Kormaridda, oo wadaaddadiina way saydhsaydheen dhiiggii ay gacantooda ka guddoomeen, oo kuwii reer Laawina harag bay ka bixiyeen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo iyana meel bay dhigeen qurbaannadii la gubayay inay sidii qaybihii reerihii dadku ay kala ahaayeen Rabbiga wax ugu bixiyaan si waafaqsan waxa ku qoran kitaabkii Muuse. Oo dibidiina sidaasoo kalay u galeen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo sidii qaynuunku ahaa ayay neefafkii Kormaridda dab ugu dubeen, oo qurbaannadii quduuska ahaana waxay ku kariyeen dheryo iyo digsiyo iyo weelal kale oo waaweyn, oo intay qaadeen ayay haddiiba u geeyeen dadkii oo dhan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo dabadeedna wax bay u diyaariyeen nafsaddoodii iyo wadaaddadii, maxaa yeelay, wadaaddadii reer Haaruun waxay ilaa habeenkii bixinayeen qurbaannada la gubo iyo baruurtaba, sidaas daraaddeed kuwii reer Laawi wax bay u diyaariyeen nafsaddoodii iyo wadaaddadii reer Haaruunba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo nimankii gabayaaga ahaa oo reer Aasaafna waxay joogeen meeshoodii sidii uu ahaa amarkii Daa'uud, iyo Aasaaf, iyo Heemaan, iyo Yeduutuun oo ahaa boqorka wax arkihiisii, oo iridjoogayaashiina waxay joogeen irid kasta, oo iyagu uma ay baahnayn inay hawshooda ka tagaan, waayo, iyaga waxaa wax u diyaarin jiray walaalahoodii reer Laawi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sidaasaa hawshii Rabbiga loo diyaariyey isku maalintaas in Iidda Kormaridda la dhawro iyo in qurbaannada la gubo lagu bixiyo meeshii allabariga ee Rabbiga, sidii uu ahaa amarkii Boqor Yoosiyaah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Reer binu Israa'iil oo markaas joogayna wakhtigaasay dhawrayeen Iiddii Kormaridda iyo Iiddii Kibista-aan-khamiirka-lahaynba intii toddoba maalmood ah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo Iiddaas Kormaridda mid la mid ah dalka Israa'iil laguma iidin tan iyo wakhtigii Nebi Samuu'eel, oo boqorradii reer binu Israa'iilna midkoodna ma uu iidin Iiddii Kormaridda siday iideen Yoosiyaah, iyo wadaaddadii, iyo kuwii reer Laawi, iyo kulli dadka Yahuudah iyo dadka Israa'iil ee joogay oo dhan, iyo dadkii Yeruusaalem degganaaba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo Iiddaas Kormaridda waxaa la iiday sannaddii siddeed iyo tobnaad oo boqornimadii Yoosiyaah.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Dhimashadii Yoosiyaah",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo waxyaalahaas oo dhan dabadood markuu Yoosiyaah macbudkii diyaariyey ayaa boqorkii Masar oo Nekoo la odhan jiray u soo baxay inuu la diriro Karkemiish oo u dhowayd Webi Yufraad, oo Yoosiyaahna isagii buu ku soo baxay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Laakiinse ergooyin buu u diray, oo wuxuu ku yidhi, Boqorka dalka Yahuudahow, maxaan kaa qabaa? Maanta adiga kuguma aan soo bixin, laakiinse waxaan ku soo baxay reerka aan colka la ahay; oo Ilaahna wuxuu igu amray inaan dhaqsado, haddaba Ilaaha ila jira ka joogso yuu ku baabbi'ine. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Habase yeeshee Yoosiyaah wuu diiday inuu wejigiisii ka jeediyo, laakiinse wuu ismidab rogay si uu ula diriro, oo ma uu maqlin erayadii Nekoo ee afka Ilaah ka soo baxay, wuuse yimid inuu kula diriro dooxadii Megiddoo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasay qaansaleydii fallaadh ku ganeen Boqor Yoosiyaah, dabadeedna boqorkii wuxuu addoommadiisii ku yidhi, War si xun baan u dhaawacmaye i fogeeya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sidaas daraaddeed addoommadiisii gaadhifaraskii way ka dejiyeen oo waxay saareen gaadhifaraskii labaad ee uu lahaa, oo waxay isagii keeneen Yeruusaalem, halkaasuuna ku dhintay, oo waxaa lagu aasay qabuurihii awowayaashiis. Oo dadkii Yahuudah iyo Yeruusaalem oo dhan Yoosiyaah way u baroorteen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo Yeremyaahna waa u baroortay Yoosiyaah, oo ilaa maantadan la joogo ragga gabya iyo naagaha gabya oo dhanba waxay baroortoodii kaga sheekeeyeen Yoosiyaah, oo taasna dalka Israa'iil qaynuun baa lagaga dhigay, oo bal eeg, waxay ku qoran tahay kitaabka baroorta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haddaba Yoosiyaah falimihiisii kale iyo camalladiisii wanwanaagsanaa, sida ku qoran sharciga Rabbiga, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
